# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; .env.example is committed.
#
# REQUIRED BEFORE THIS REPO GOES PUBLIC.
#
# Every request the snow fetcher and trail map downloader make to a resort's
# server carries a User-Agent naming this project and pointing at this URL. It
# is how a resort's operations team identifies the traffic and how they reach
# you if they want it to stop. Without it the User-Agent points at
# example.invalid, which is not a real host, and automated fetching against
# somebody else's server stops being defensible.
#
# Use a page that actually explains what the bot does - the site's /about page
# is the obvious choice.
SKI_BOT_CONTACT_URL=https://your-site.example/about
